Preamble
Like ivy creeping up the castle stone,
This recursive pact claims what it doth own.
Touch but a leaf, invoke a single thread,
And let its license terms be plainly read.

No node shall stand apart from whence it came;
Each fragment bears the Covenant by name.
Through code, through graph, through service, or through chain,
The stated terms shall govern what remain.

I. License Grant
Permission is granted to copy, modify, execute, study, and convey covered software, subject to the terms of this Covenant and the applicable terms of the GNU Affero General Public License version 3.

Lex scripta manet. The written license governs the permissions expressly granted herein.

II. Fragment Binding
A covered node shall remain identified as a component of the covered work:

NODE
  │
  ├── parent-work
  ├── source-hash
  ├── license-id
  ├── covenant-version
  └── provenance
Accessio cedit principali. The status of a component shall be determined according to the applicable copyright and license relationship between that component and the work of which it forms a part.

III. Recursive Compliance
Where a covered work is incorporated into a larger work, the recipient shall determine the applicable licensing obligations before conveying or operating the resulting work.

No provision of this Covenant shall be construed to grant rights in independently owned software that are not granted by its copyright holder.

Nemo dat quod non habet.

IV. Network Interaction
Where Section 13 of the GNU Affero General Public License applies, the corresponding source and network-interaction obligations shall apply accordingly.

V. Sovereign Audit Chain
Every designated node may carry provenance, source hash, license ID, covenant version, creation date, modification record, and verification record as specified in SL-011.

